amed constant, then the package's exported names."}, {"id": "docs_notebook_map_phase_03_muat_data", "label": "3 \u00b7 Muat data & hukum segmen", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/NOTEBOOK_MAP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Load the immutable artifact, cut the series at every gap, then assert the per-origin window budget by exact equality."}, {"id": "docs_notebook_map_phase_04_pra_proses", "label": "4 \u00b7 Pra-proses \u2014 dua belas variat", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/NOTEBOOK_MAP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Per-bar functions of the current bar, except r which uses the current and previous close. No rolling window anywhere."}, {"id": "docs_notebook_map_phase_05_efisiensi", "label": "5 \u00b7 Uji efisiensi pasar", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/NOTEBOOK_MAP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "ADF, Lo-MacKinlay variance ratio and the Hurst exponent \u2014 full sample and each 21-month training sub-block."}, {"id": "docs_notebook_map_phase_06_split", "label": "6 \u00b7 Split walk-forward & scaler", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/NOTEBOOK_MAP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "H-step purge at both boundaries, and a StandardScaler fitted only on the 21-month training sub-block."}, {"id": "docs_notebook_map_phase_07_keff", "label": "7 \u00b7 Dimensionalitas efektif \u2014 Stage 3b", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/NOTEBOOK_MAP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "K_eff is RQ1's independent variable and it is measured before a single epoch runs."}, {"id": "docs_notebook_map_phase_08_algoritma", "label": "8 \u00b7 Algoritma \u2014 arsitektur iTransformer", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/NOTEBOOK_MAP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Encoder-only. Each variate is one token and attention runs across variates, not across time."}, {"id": "docs_notebook_map_phase_09_loop_latih", "label": "9 \u00b7 Loop latih & kontrak keterlacakan", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/NOTEBOOK_MAP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "GPU-resident training loop with no DataLoader, plus the CLAUDE.md section 12 traceability contract every run writes."}, {"id": "docs_notebook_map_phase_10_metrik", "label": "10 \u00b7 Metrik & uji statistik", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/NOTEBOOK_MAP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every estimator the paper uses: metrics, DM/Clark-West, survival, and the wild cluster bootstrap for beta1."}, {"id": "docs_notebook_map_phase_11_baseline", "label": "11 \u00b7 Baseline", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/NOTEBOOK_MAP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ridge, DLinear, PatchTST, LSTM and the two naive comparators \u2014 each with an explicit K (D40)."}, {"id": "docs_notebook_map_phase_12_perbandingan", "label": "12 \u00b7 Perbandingan model", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/NOTEBOOK_MAP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Pair matrix, Romano-Wolf stepdown, and the Model Confidence Set (D35)."}, {"id": "docs_notebook_map_phase_13_ekonomi", "label": "13 \u00b7 Evaluasi ekonomi", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/NOTEBOOK_MAP.md",