urce_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Producing cell 356 in phase evaluasi. MEMBACA: artifacts/preds/*.parquet, artifacts/meta/*.json. MENULIS: \u2014. RQ1 \u2014 nominal K or K_eff? Free rung effects, TOST equivalence on the 8->12 rung, non-nested J-test."}, {"id": "docs_notebook_map_step_rq2", "label": "step `rq2` (cell 358)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/NOTEBOOK_MAP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Producing cell 358 in phase evaluasi. MEMBACA: artifacts/preds/*.parquet, artifacts/meta/*.json. MENULIS: \u2014. RQ2 \u2014 does the gap narrow with model age? A(i,b) = alpha_i + beta1*b + eps, wild cluster bootstrap, G = 15."}, {"id": "docs_notebook_map_step_rq3", "label": "step `rq3` (cell 360)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/NOTEBOOK_MAP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Producing cell 360 in phase evaluasi. MEMBACA: artifacts/preds/*.parquet, artifacts/meta/*.json. MENULIS: \u2014. RQ3 \u2014 optimal retraining cadence? Branches to UNDEFINED when every origin fails the R2_oos > 0 guard (D55, D60b)."}, {"id": "docs_notebook_map_step_save", "label": "step `save` (cell 363)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/NOTEBOOK_MAP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Producing cell 363 in phase simpan. MEMBACA: artifacts/preds/*.parquet, artifacts/meta/*.json. MENULIS: artifacts/paper_numbers.json, artifacts/run_block_metrics.parquet, artifacts/seed_averaged_cells.parquet, artifacts/amplification_panel.parquet, artifacts/decay_panel.parquet. Save the metric panels \u2014 the immutable grid-side evidence CLAUDE.md section 12 requires every number to resolve to."}, {"id": "docs_notebook_map_step_report",